00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:05.660
yada, but no, I mean, I'm just surprised that they would be that bold.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:10.540
If you're going to go for it, if you're going to say buy chess because we made it better,

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.560
that's the only way to say it, right?

