00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:39.060
They do have guns in chess.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.660
There's guns in battle chess.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.980
True. Which is what makes it better.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:49.140
I guess there are. Yeah, depending on which set you get, right?

