Yes, giant chess.

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:07.980
Isn't their version of giant chess just battle chess?

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.760
Kinda, yeah. I mean, their version of regular chess is just battle chess.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:16.620
It might be, now don't quote me on this, but it might be a little tiny bit faster than

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.600
battle chess. Just a little bit.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.500
