00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:32.300
happening because they just sort of start like stepping around each other.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.240
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.780
One gets out of the way for the other.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.220
