That's what I'm saying. I'm saying not add randomness, but add, like, the thing, alright, you, you, you have a pawn diagonal to, to a knight.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:28.240
The pawn in regular chess takes the knight, so, in this case, now the pawn has a major health or, or power advantage, but the knight still has a chance to defend itself, kind of like a knight.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:39.480
I think you are adding randomness, because you're removing, like, before, like, if, if it, if it works out that a knight moves into a bishop spot,

