00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:03.860
That's adding randomness, because it's now, it's based off of, like, your, I don't see that as randomness.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:09.540
I don't think I'm saying randomness, though, I'm saying, like, you have to then make it, like, an actual, like, street fighter fight, where,

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:18.220
