00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.660
That it's getting all this, like, love after the fact?

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:23.940
I think it was just cheap.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:25.900
Yeah. I think it's cheap to make.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:29.940
