Well, Interplay, like, was the company that released, like, Fallout.

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:49.820
Yes. The very same.

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:50.940
I just wanted to make sure.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.520
Yeah. Mm-hmm. Wow.

